13819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You won\u2019t have to face the darkness alone. Invite a friend to take over one of your heroes and act as your companion. Your companion always follows you into battle and levels alongside your main character. Your companions will be as powerful as you have grown them to be! You can play Co-op through Steam Remote Play or locally.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388460/extras/41f646f52e32d108dcd156687d686e46.webp?t=1715713819\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388460/extras/1cd2b75716fc6abf7a4f3ba3eed0792f.poster.avif?t=1715713819\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388460/extras/1cd2b75716fc6abf7a4f3ba3eed0792f.webm?t=1715713819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388460/extras/1cd2b75716fc6abf7a4f3ba3eed0792f.mp4?t=1715713819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Absorb necromantic essence to find and enhance attacks and passives each run to grow stronger against Tar-Baphon's forces. Use attribute points to increase Strength, Dexterity, Constitution, Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma. Upgrade your talent tree and get deeper customization options by unlocking new attacks and passive abilities.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388460/extras/2f4fa2c73c7392c57247dba698372407.webp?t=1715713819\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388460/extras/8dfea6151558e33894d8317a85fd1bf3.poster.avif?t=1715713819\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388460/extras/8dfea6151558e33894d8317a85fd1bf3.webm?t=1715713819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388460/extras/8dfea6151558e33894d8317a85fd1bf3.mp4?t=1715713819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore dungeons, find hidden treasure chests, and let fate decide your fortune with d20 rolls. Use gold to upgrade potent consumables like healing potions and spell-like effects. Find Tyrant\u2019s statues to unlock permanent upgrades. We tied them with collectible cards that showcase incredible Paizo\u2019s art from monsters to items.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388460/extras/585a203857d898b4dc6fd028961a0725.webp?t=1715713819\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388460/extras/dd60ae32b4146b470f6de185eb98bf55.avif?t=1715713819\" /></span>",
    "short_description": "A roguelite survivor game set in the beloved world of Pathfinder. Enter Gallowspire, Pathfinder\u2019s legendary tower of darkness, alongside your fearless companion. Slay hordes of enemies, upgrade your arsenal, and overcome deadly bosses to seal away the ancient king of undeath Tar-Baphon!",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Swedish, Ukrainian",
    "reviews": "\u201cA few hours with an early preview build reveals Gallowspire Survivors is certainly more than just a Vampire Survivors clone\u2014it's full of tweaks to the formula inspired by the tabletop game.\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br><br>\u201cVenturing into the  world of Pathfinder: Gallowspire Survivors felt like stepping into a realm where strategy meets chaos. Drawing obvious inspiration from favorites like Vampire Survivors, this fantasy game offers a refreshing twist on the reverse bullet hell genre.\u201d<br>eNRD<br><br>\u201cIt is addicting, fun, and offers lots of replay value and variety\u201d<br>The Outerhaven<br>",
